# The working tree is LF throughout and the tooling preserves whatever it finds
# (.scripts/mint-ids.py sniffs the file's own newline and writes it back). Pinning
# eol=lf keeps a fresh clone identical to this one and stops Git for Windows from
# rewriting 33 files to CRLF on checkout — which would otherwise show up as a
# whole-file diff the first time anyone edits a data bank.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico  binary
